(text "RECONSTRUCTED 2026: not in the 2007 drawings." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0) (bold yes)) (justify left)) (uuid "a298f643-24a2-41a9-adb8-102959c13028"))
(text "The 2007 figures show only the 8088 side of the 8284 (Fig 1: \"8284 Pin 8, 5, 10\").\nThis sheet is rebuilt from the 8284A datasheet and skeet.asm:\n  12 MHz crystal, F/~{C} low: CLK = 4 MHz (8088), PCLK = 2 MHz (8253 clocks).\n  Always ready: RDY1 high + ~{AEN1} low; RDY2 low + ~{AEN2} high. ~{ASYNC} low.\n  ~{RES}: 10k / 10uF power-on reset (about 100 ms) plus a reset button.\n  Power pins (VCC 18, GND 9) not drawn, as on the 2007 figures." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "6b04dad1-a7e4-485d-8f64-470d0654e042"))
